Source: pg-statecharts
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-server-dev-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/kronor-io/statecharts

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-statecharts
Architecture: all
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION, ${misc:Depends}
Description: hierarchical state machines inside PostgreSQL transactions
 SQL and PL/pgSQL state machines with hierarchical and parallel states,
 transactional event handling and versioned statechart definitions.
 Requires ltree in the public schema. No preload or restart is needed.

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-statecharts-dev
Architecture: all
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-statecharts (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: SCXML import and migration tooling for pg_statecharts
 Optional development tooling for importing SCXML and generating Sqitch
 migrations. Reading and writing server files requires additional privileges.
